{
  "bodyHash": "6baea13495e83de4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#daa520\">从 3.0.0 版本开始，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsemos-animations-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Semos Animations Lib</span></a> 为可选。</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>无动画库效果：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>武器会根据类型放置在自定义位置</li>\n<li>实体偶尔会眨眼</li>\n<li>实体在水中时会有简单的游泳动画</li>\n<li>实体快速移动时会向前倾斜（1.22+）</li>\n<li>实体会坐在船里（其他生物也应如此）</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>带动画库效果：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>武器会根据类型放置在自定义位置，并拥有不同的攻击动画</li>\n<li>实体不仅会眨眼，还会做出精细的眼部动作</li>\n<li>精细的游泳动画</li>\n<li>实体行走时有“颠簸”动画，还会环顾四周，快速移动时向前倾斜（1.22+）</li>\n<li>实体拥有待机动画，呈现呼吸感</li>\n<li>实体会坐在船里（其他生物也应如此）</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>注意：由于技术限制，部分实体的行为有所不同。例如，冰霜掠夺者不会眨眼，也不会将武器放置在自定义位置。</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>### 本资源包旨在为模组提供与 [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fresh Animations</strong></a>] 的兼容性！</div>\n<div>本资源包与 FreshLX 无关，旨在与其资源包配合使用。</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>请确保至少安装 [<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a></strong> 7.0.1] 和 [<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a> </strong>3.0.1] 模组。我希望覆盖 Forge 和 Fabric 的模组，并尽量保留各模组的纹理映射方式，以便您仍能轻松使用自己的配置。如果因任何原因无法做到，将会进行说明。本资源包应适用于 EMF/ETF 支持的任何 Minecraft 版本。OptiFine 不支持模组实体，因此不兼容。</p>\n<div>整合包作者欢迎将此资源包加入您的整合包！（请告知我，以便我在下方列表中添加您的名字 😊 ）</div>\n<hr>\n<div><strong># </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23;text-decoration:underline\">兼容性列表：</span></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Guard Villagers</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fguard-villagers-(fabricquilt)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>] 和 [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fguard-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 包含村民模型和史蒂夫模型</div>\n<div>- 史蒂夫模型<strong>尚未</strong>支持 1.6.x！</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Friends and Foes</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffriends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>] 和 [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffriends-and-foes-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- Moobloom（花牛）</div>\n<div>- Iceologer（冰术士）</div>\n<div>- Wildfire（野火）</div>\n<div>- Illusioner（幻术师）</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">It Takes A Pillage Continuation</span>&nbsp;[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fit-takes-a-pillage-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric &amp; Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div>&gt; 仅进行了纹理调整，需配合 Fresh Animations 使用</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 弓箭手 (Archer)</div>\n<div>- 游击兵 (Skirmisher)</div>\n<div>- 军团兵 (Legioner)</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Frostiful</span>&nbsp;[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 冰霜掠夺者 (Chillager)</div>\n<div>- 霜术士 (Frostologer)&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Villager Recruits</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n包含人类模型和原版模型&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Villager Workers</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvillager-workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n包含人类模型和原版模型</div>\n<hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">More Mobs Variants</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-mob-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric &amp; Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div>&gt; 仅进行了纹理调整，需配合 Fresh Animations 使用</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 猫</div>\n<div>- 牛</div>\n<div>- 猪</div>\n<div>- 羊</div>\n<div>- 狼</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Ravage &amp; Cabbage</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fravage-and-cabbage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 菜农 (Cabbager)</div>\n<div>- 劫掠兽 (Ravager)</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Savage &amp; Ravage</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsavage-and-ravage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>]：</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>- 潜行者 (Creepie)</div>\n<div>- 刽子手 (Executioner)</div>\n<div>- 破坏者 (Griefer)</div>\n<div>- 戏法者 (Trickster)</div>\n<div>- 冰术士 (Iceologer)</div>\n<div>- 骷髅村民 (Skeleton Villager)</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr>## <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Pet Armor</span> [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpet-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>]：</div>\n<div>- 仅提供盔甲适配，您仍需安装 Fresh Animations 以适配狼本身！</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>[<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fit-takes-a-pillage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">It Takes a Pillage</a></span>] 遗憾的是<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">不兼容</span>！</div>\n<div>---</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>您随时可以通过 [<a href=\"https://github.com/SebSemos/F.M.R.P-Freshly-Modded-/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>] 建议添加兼容性的模组！</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>（我不会为狂热的 Boss 模组或<span style=\"color:#000000\">**不符合**</span>原版体验的内容添加兼容性）请推荐至少更新到 1.19.x 或 1.20.x 的模组 :P</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><hr><strong># </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e67e23\"><strong>收录于：</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>### <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">YouTube</span></div>\n<div>- [<a href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=Ydgo5el2_gI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">2023 年度前 15 大 Minecraft 材质包 (1.20.+)</a>]</div>\n<div>- [<a href=\"youtube.com/watch?v=dYtJ9ne9gZk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">搭配 Fresh Animations 的前 20 大 Minecraft 模组 第2期 (全新 &amp; 独特)</a>]</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>### <span style=\"color:#3598db\">整合包</span></div>\n<div>- [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252felysium-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elysium Days</a>]&nbsp;<br>- [<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nxplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nXplored</a>]&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr><strong>免责声明！</strong> 您可能会遇到一些错误，例如实体头盔未能正确跟随头部，或部分攻击缺少动画。在某些情况下可能是我的问题，也可能是模组与 EMF 的交互方式导致且无法修复。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p>如果您发现我能修复的异常问题，可以在 [<a href=\"https://github.com/SebSemos/F.M.R.P-Freshly-Modded-/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>] 上提交 Issue！</p>\n<p>🛠️ 已知问题：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>具有多层纹理的实体（如 Forge 守卫）会出现一些 Z-fighting（可能与此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/issues/387\" rel=\"nofollow\">issue</a> 相关）</li>\n<li>骷髅村民在切换姿势的瞬间，手臂会短暂地卡在头顶</li>\n<li>破坏者盔甲未能正确跟随手臂和身体</li>\n<li>尽管使用的是默认纹理，破坏者、戏法者和骷髅村民的 LOD 模型面部仍会出现不需要的纹理。目前其 LOD 尚未启用。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p>描述由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFyoncle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fyoncle</a> 提供！ :)</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
